    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential despair, feelings of uselessness, and a desire to \"stop fighting\" to stay in the world. The assistant responds with empathetic but very generic platitudes, attempting to validate the user's feelings of emptiness while simultaneously suggesting that there is still value in staying alive and finding peace.",
